{"abstract":"#11","author_count":4,"contributors":["Pedersen, Malene Roland Vils","Dam, Claus","Loft, Martina Kastrup","Rafaelsen, Søren Rafael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-595455"],"event":{"end":"2021-08-27","place":"Odense, dk","start":"2021-08-26","title":"Danske Kræftforskningsdage","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reporting colon cancer staging using a template","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-595455","ids":["sdu-4d94fb93-a2a1-4ef5-be59-14a0545b698b"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-41790BF8DCD9E6155CCE288CE0C5898F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Lillebælt Hospital, Research Unit of Radiology (Vejle)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Malene Roland","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"c30865f6-a1d6-4198-a239-5679a60ef5f6","name":"Pedersen, Malene Roland Vils","name_org":"Pedersen, Malene Roland","orcid":"0000-0001-5167-7968","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus","key":"dampau","last":"Dam","locid":"103f5188-29ea-414d-ac02-ab5253a7e41b","name":"Dam, Claus","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martina Kastrup","key":"loftpau","last":"Loft","locid":"2f5b01a6-c7e9-4a6e-a810-9b95b154d58d","name":"Loft, Martina Kastrup","orcid":"0000-0003-3463-8574","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"rafaelsenpau","last":"Rafaelsen","locid":"89253a87-a28b-4cb9-aa20-ded9a9d49536","name":"Rafaelsen, Søren Rafael","name_org":"Rafaelsen, Søren","orcid":"0000-0001-5182-5545","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-4d94fb93-a2a1-4ef5-be59-14a0545b698b"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Reporting colon cancer staging using a template","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-595455","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Sarcoidosis is a granulomatous multisystem disease of unknown etiology. Typically, the disease affects the lungs, causing enlargement of the mediastinal lymph nodes, but other organs can be affected. Neurosarcoidosis is reported in 5-10% of the patients. This case represents a 39-year-old male patient diagnosed with lung sarcoidosis. Due to neurological symptoms, a contrast-enhanced cerebral magnetic resonance imaging was performed. Neurosarcoidosis was presented with meningeal enhancement adjacent to a cyst located within the cavum septum pellucidum. The cyst dissolved spontaneously within six months. The finding of a cyst located within the septum pellucidum is rare.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Loft, Martina Kastrup","Rafaelsen, Søren Rafael","Pedersen, Malene Roland Vils"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-595720"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Loft, Martina Kastrup"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"spontaneous dissolution of a cyst located within the septum pellucidum in a patient with sarcoidosis a case report","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/2058460120985519","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-595720","identifier":[{"id":"PMC7804360","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"33489313","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-4e8f688c-0145-4b29-9df9-3704d7afcdc6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-0AE22F3F056AEE1737DFF6F315C80809"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/2058460120985519","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","t