{"author_count":23,"contributors":["Midtgaard, Søren Roi","Darwish, Tamim A.","Pedersen, Martin Cramer","Huda, Pie","Larsen, Andreas Haahr","Jensen, Grethe Vestergaard","Kynde, Søren Andreas Røssell","Skar-Gislinge, Nicholas","Nielsen, Agnieszka Janina Zygadlo","Olesen, Claus","Blaise, Mickael","Dorosz, Jerzy Józef","Thorsen, Thor Seneca","Venskutonyte, Raminta","Krintel, Christian","Møller, Jesper Vuust","Frielinghaus, Henrich","Gilbert, Elliot Paul","Martel, Anne","Kastrup, Jette Sandholm","Jensen, Poul Erik","Nissen, Poul","Arleth, Lise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-238900"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Midtgaard, Søren Roi"],"country":["Australia","France","Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Australian National University","Institut Laue-Langevin","Jülich Research Centre ( FZJ )"],"keyword":["Deuteration","Membrane Proteins","SANS","Small angle neutron scattering"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"invisible detergents for structure determination of membrane proteins by small angle neutron scattering","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85039723710","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors acknowledge Dr. Robert Knott at ANSTO and Dr. Adam Round at ESRF for their assistance in obtaining supporting SAXS data. We thank ANSTO, ILL and FRM II for awarding us beamtime for this project at, respectively, the QUOKKA, D22 and KWS-1 instruments. RV, CK, TST, JJD and JSK thank Eric Gouaux for providing the GluA2cryst construct and protein purification protocol. Dr. Frank Gabel and Dr. Christine Ebel are thanked for kindly providing data on the tail-deuterated detergents previously published in [28]. PhD student Nicolai Tidemand Johansen is thanked for helping with the SANS measurements of GluA2. We thank the Danish Agency for Science, Technology and Innovation funding agency for making this study possible through a Sapere Aude grant to LA. RV, CK, and JSK acknowledge the support from the Lundbeck Foundation, The Danish Council for Independent Research – Medical Sciences and GluTarget. The authors also acknowledge financial support from the Center for Synthetic Biology (bioSYNergy) funded by the UCPH Excellence Programme for Interdisciplinary Research and to the Lundbeck foundation “BRAIN-STRUC” project. The National Deuteration Facility is partly supported by the National Collaborative Research Infrastructure Strategy – an initiative of the Australian Government. The authors acknowledge Dr. Robert Knott at ANSTO and Dr. Adam Round at ESRF for their assistance in obtaining supporting SAXS data. We thank ANSTO, ILL and FRM II for awarding us beamtime for this project at, respectively, the QUOKKA, D22 and KWS-1 instruments. RV, CK, TST, JJD and JSK thank Eric Gouaux for providing the GluA2cryst construct and protein purification protocol. Dr. Frank Gabel and Dr. Christine Ebel are thanked for kindly providing data on the tail-deuterated detergents previously published in. PhD student Nicolai Tidemand Johansen is thanked for helping with the SANS measurements of GluA2. We thank the Danish Agency for Science, Technology and Innovation funding agency for making this study possible through a Sapere Aude grant to LA. RV, CK, and JSK acknowledge the support from the Lundbeck Foundation, The Danish Council for Independent Research ? Medical Sciences and GluTarget. The authors also acknowledge financial support from the Center for Synthetic Biology (bioSYNergy) funded by the UCPH Excellence Programme for Interdisciplinary Research and to the Lundbeck foundation ?BRAINSTRUC? project. The National Deuteration Facility is partly supported by the National Collaborative Research Infrastructure Strategy ? an initiative of the Australian Government."],"id":"S01-000.00-238900","identifier":[{"id":"29178440","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85039723710","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-c0006fce-42c9-49f9-8cc5-fdbe5f13515e"],"keyword":["Contrast matching","Deuteration","Membrane proteins","SANS","Small-angle neutron scattering"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-85A2F523568768C9E6BBADF16351A868"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"australian national university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Australian National University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Biomedicine, Department of Biomedicine - Forskning og uddannelse, Vest"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"jülich research centre","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Jülich Research Centre ( FZJ )","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"fr","key":"institut laue langevin","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Institut Laue-Langevin","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Roi","key":"midtgaardsørenroipau","last":"Midtgaard","name":"Midtgaard, Søren Roi","rank":1,"r