{"abstract":"A novel and generally applicable method for determining structures of membrane proteins in solution via small-angle neutron scattering (SANS) is presented. Common detergents for solubilizing membrane proteins were synthesized in isotope-substituted versions for utilizing the intrinsic neutron scattering length difference between hydrogen and deuterium. Individual hydrogen/deuterium levels of the detergent head and tail groups were achieved such that the formed micelles became effectively invisible in heavy water (D2 O) when investigated by neutrons. This way, only the signal from the membrane protein remained in the SANS data. We demonstrate that the method is not only generally applicable on five very different membrane proteins but also reveals subtle structural details about the sarco/endoplasmatic reticulum Ca2+ ATPase (SERCA). In all, the synthesis of isotope-substituted detergents makes solution structure determination of membrane proteins by SANS and subsequent data analysis available to non-specialists. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Midtgaard, Søren Roi","Darwish, Tamim A","Pedersen, Martin Cramer","Huda, Pie","Larsen, Andreas Haahr","Jensen, Grethe Vestergaard","Kynde, Søren Andreas Røssell","Skar-Gislinge, Nicholas","Nielsen, Agnieszka Janina Zygadlo","Olesen, Claus","Blaise, Mickael","Dorosz, Jerzy","Thorsen, Thor Seneca","Venskutonytė, Raminta","Krintel, Christian","Møller, Jesper V.","Frielinghaus, Henrich","Gilbert, Elliot Paul","Martel, Anne","Kastrup, Jette Sandholm","Jensen, Poul Erik","Nissen, Poul","Arleth, Lise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-470455"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"invisible detergents for structure determination of membrane proteins by small angle neutron scattering","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-470455","identifier":[{"id":"85039723710","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29178440","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-80a8bd4f-22d9-4524-98ca-50c35822474b"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-85A2F523568768C9E6BBADF16351A868"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Niels Bohr Institute, Xray and Neutron Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Søren Roi","key":"midtgaardsørenroipau","last":"Midtgaard","locid":"af8c25d3-54a3-485c-9afd-0c3d6da84a6f","name":"Midtgaard, Søren Roi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tamim A","key":"darwishtamimapau","last":"Darwish","name":"Darwish, Tamim A","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Martin Cramer","key":"pedersenmartincramerpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"faa1ab31-1ac6-47e7-a3d4-c3788701318e","name":"Pedersen, Martin Cramer","orcid":"0000-0002-8982-7615","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Pie","key":"hudapiepau","last":"Huda","locid":"43c1f58d-f0a0-4be2-bb04-b29af3fec000","name":"Huda, P